cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "lob-imbalance-signals: Order flow imbalance features and transformer models for limit order book prediction"
abstract: >
  An open-source implementation and benchmark of order flow imbalance (OFI)
  features for short-horizon mid-price prediction on limit order book data.
  Implements classical OFI regression (Cont, Kukanov, Stoikov 2014), XGBoost,
  and transformer-based sequence models under walk-forward cross-validation
  with leakage purging. Designed to consume LOBSTER-format L2 book data.
